# Build output
bin/
obj/
/publish/
/releases/
/releases-beta-local/
/publish-preview/
/releases-preview/
.vs/

# Credentials - never commit.
/Secrets/
*client_secret*.json

# Logs and local noise
*.log

# Bundled binary that is not ours to redistribute
Sentrychan.App/Assets/frpc.exe
# Internal working notes: monetization strategy, security posture, unfinished work.
# Deliberately not published - see the note in the first commit's review.
/CLAUDE.md

# Local editor/agent scratch (dev-server launch config etc.) — except the shared
# work plan, which a cloud session has to be able to read from the repo.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Built source packs kept locally for testing / distribution.
# These MUST NOT reach the public repo - the sources-as-plugins split is the
# whole legal separation. Never remove this rule.
/sources/
*.Sources.dll

# Local-only material that must never be published (e.g. the source pack, kept
# at _local\source-pack with its own history). Never remove this rule.
/_local/

